Mopidy-Epaper bundles unmodified driver sources from Waveshare's e-Paper
repository (https://github.com/waveshareteam/e-Paper):

    mopidy_epaper/drivers/epd2in13_V4.py
    mopidy_epaper/drivers/epdconfig.py

They are vendored because the `waveshare-epaper` package on PyPI predates the
V4 revision of the 2.13" panel and does not include this driver.

